WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
I chose The Olea Group because its owner has a heart for the community, just like I do.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.400
Even though she is a broker and the owner of a business,

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.700
she has a heart for family and community, and she is there for the agents.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:20.700
She is not just a businesswoman. She is a friend, family, and a mother.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.000
She understands where you are and what you stand for, and I value that.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.100
She has the same values I do. That is why I chose The Olea Group.
